zero motion sickness!\n\n#VRDrift #DriftingGame #MetaQuest #VRCars #RacingSim #AdrenalineRush\n\n\ud83d\udc49 GRAB THE WHEEL!\nOnly on Meta Horizon Store\nSearch: \ud83d\udd0e \u201cDrift V\u201d\n\nQuest 2/3/Pro | Comfort: Comfortable\n\nYOUR DRIFT LEGEND STARTS NOW! \ud83d\udca8\ud83c\udf1f", "short_description": "Drift V \ud83c\udfc1\ud83d\udd25\nBECOME A DRIFT LEGEND!\nStrap into Meta Quest\u2019s ultimate VR drifting sim! Master 9 FREE cars across 12 adrenaline-fueled levels.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 FREE DREAM CARS\n\ud83c\udf00 12 SIDEWAYS LEVELS\n\n\u2705 TRUE-TO-LIFE PHYSICS\n- FEEL every tire scream & weight shift!\n- Battle pro-level AI drift rivals!\n\n\ud83c\udfac EPIC CUTSCENES\n\ud83c\udfae COMFORT-FOCUSED: Smooth controls, zero nausea!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/driftv/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/driftv/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24913112468296225"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 13, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1795159695200590"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "24843796601984170"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "14